---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Stay
permalink: /stay/
description: "Where to stay near the wedding: waterfront motels and inns on Bailey Island, hotels in Brunswick, and cottage rentals around Harpswell."
---
{#- Republished 2026-07-16 (Patrick): general lodging info for now — verified hotels
    around Harpswell and Brunswick. The Harpswell Inn itself is deliberately NOT
    listed (Carolyn, 2026-08-02: guests staying there will be told directly); the
    room-block card leads the grid instead. The per-guest room-block view (sign-in)
    can layer on later; see docs/data-lodging.md for the verified source data. -#}
<section class="section section--scene" style="--scene:var(--scene-lookout)">
  <div class="wrap center stack">
    <span class="label eyebrow">Where to stay</span>
    <h1>A place to rest your head</h1>
    <p class="lead">A few options near the inn, from the water's edge to nearby Brunswick.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    {#- Shuttle note per Carolyn (2026-08-22): leads the page so guests read it
        before picking a hotel. Same facts echoed on Travel + FAQ. -#}
    <div class="card" style="max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 28px">
      <h3>Shuttles &amp; parking</h3>
      <p style="margin:0">{{ site.stayNote }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {% for s in site.stay %}
      <div class="card">
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.note }}</p>
        {% if s.phone %}<p style="margin:0 0 8px"><a class="btn btn--ink" href="tel:{{ s.phone | replace('(','') | replace(')','') | replace(' ','') | replace('-','') }}">Call {{ s.phone }}</a></p>{% endif %}
        {% if s.url and s.url != '#' %}<p style="margin:0"><a href="{{ s.url }}" rel="noopener">Their site &rarr;</a></p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="note center" style="margin-top:28px">Booking details and any room block will be confirmed here. August books up early out here, so grab a room once you know you're coming.</p>
  </div>
</section>
